    "x1": 5610,
    "z1": 5015
   },
   "text": "His diary, open. The last entry is shaky:\n\"it itches. hide in the mine till they come.\""
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 5610,
    "z0": 3570,
    "x1": 6120,
    "z1": 5015
   },
   "text": "The first aid tin, emptied. Bandage wrappers everywhere.\nHe did what he could with it."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 3145,
    "z0": 6630,
    "x1": 4420,
    "z1": 7480
   },
   "text": "A key on a hook by the door. The tag says QUARRY OFFICE."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 6545,
    "z0": 1700,
    "x1": 8330,
    "z1": 3400
   },
   "text": "The sink is full of towels. They're soaked through.\nThe water's pink."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 3995,
    "z0": 1700,
    "x1": 5695,
    "z1": 3230
   },
   "text": "A girl holding up a fish, grinning. The same photo was in the booth.\nA drawing under it, in crayon: DAD."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 3400,
    "z0": 1700,
    "x1": 3995,
    "z1": 3230
   },
   "text": "The radio's on, hissing. Nothing on any channel."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 2380,
    "z0": 5780,
    "x1": 4080,
    "z1": 7480
   },
   "text": "He dragged the chair to the window and sat watching the path.\nBinoculars. Cold coffee."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 1700,
    "z0": 1700,
    "x1": 3740,
    "z1": 5270
   },
   "text": "The bed's been slept in, or tried. Blood on the pillow."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 5950,
    "z0": 6460,
    "x1": 9180,
    "z1": 7480
   },
   "text": "Fishing rods, a creel, waders. A man who liked quiet."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 4080,
    "z0": 6800,
    "x1": 4930,
    "z1": 7480
   },
   "text": "The bolt's drawn and the bar's off the door.\nHe locked himself in, then thought better of it."
  }
 ],
